`crates/remuda-claude-wire` implements the Claude Code stream-json control
protocol from Remuda research notes (`docs/research/claude-stream-json-protocol.md`)
and live CLI 2.1.268 fixtures. It was cross-checked against vibe-kanban
(Apache-2.0) `crates/executors/src/executors/claude/{types.rs,protocol.rs,client.rs}`
as a protocol subset. No vibe-kanban source was copied; differences (initialize
handshake wait, `--include-hook-events`, `--forward-subagent-text`, not
breaking on the first `result`) are documented in
`crates/remuda-claude-wire/README.md`.

